cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it and the companion manuscript."
title: "Slab model with two-dimensional full horizontal velocity-gradient tensor"
authors:
  - family-names: Kim
    given-names: Sung Yong
    affiliation: "Korea Advanced Institute of Science and Technology"
version: "0.1.1"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/syongkim/ni-slab-edu"
abstract: >-
  Educational Python for a slab mixed-layer model with a two-dimensional full
  horizontal velocity-gradient tensor. Implements the transfer function H
  (equations 12-16) and Green function G (equations 17-22), and redraws
  manuscript Figures 2 and 3.
keywords:
  - near-inertial
  - mixed layer
  - slab model
  - transfer function
  - Green function
  - oceanography
